# Build context for docker/web.Dockerfile and docker/mcp.Dockerfile (docs/ci-cd.md).
# The images need the pnpm workspace sources and nothing else: keep secrets, history, build output
# and tooling out of the context. Do not exclude a directory that is a pnpm workspace member
# (see pnpm-workspace.yaml), because `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` needs every member present.

# Version control and CI
.git
.github

# Dependencies and build output (the image installs and builds from scratch)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log

# Local configuration and secrets: only the documented example is ever tracked
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Test output and editor files
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
.idea
.vscode
.DS_Store

# Not needed to build the services
docs
dev
scripts
docker
docker-compose.yml
**/*.md
LICENSE
